      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "URANA STORM (5) goes very well this trip starting eight times for three wins and two minors. Scored by 5 lengths last time (30.10) in a Grade 5 over 525m at The Meadows. Rates on top and should go close. HEATHCOTE RUPEE (8) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (30.44) at this track behind Galloping Jessie in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Winning chance. VERA JAKIT (1) comes off an average effort last start when sixth at this track over 515m behind Galloping Jessie (30.98) in a Grade 5. Was a winner prior to that. Great chance to atone. CENTAUREA (2) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
